            keyword frequency, which may miss conceptually related questions that use different
            terminology. It is a useful heuristic but not a semantic understanding of question content.
        </li>
    </ul>

    <div class="callout info">
        <strong>Recommendation for Future Work:</strong> A longitudinal study that incorporates the
        missing 2020 data, distinguishes annual from supplementary papers, and applies a standardized
        topic taxonomy (rather than keyword heuristics) would provide deeper and more reliable insights.
